{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1175","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Yet Another Partiton Problem"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given array $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$. You need to split it into $$$k$$$ subsegments (so every element is included in exactly one subsegment)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The weight of a subsegment $$$a_l, a_{l+1}, \\dots, a_r$$$ is equal to $$$(r - l + 1) \\cdot \\max\\limits_{l \\le i \\le r}(a_i)$$$. The weight of a partition is a total weight of all its segments."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the partition of minimal weight."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^4$$$, $$$1 \\le k \\le \\min(100, n)$$$) — the length of the array $$$a$$$ and the number of subsegments in the partition."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 2 \\cdot 10^4$$$) — the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print single integer — the minimal weight among all possible partitions."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 2\n6 1 7 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n25\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 3\n6 1 7 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n21\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 4\n5 1 5 1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n21\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The optimal partition in the first example is next: $$$6$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$7$$$ $$$\\bigg|$$$ $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The optimal partition in the second example is next: $$$6$$$ $$$\\bigg|$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$\\bigg|$$$ $$$7$$$ $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One of the optimal partitions in the third example is next: $$$5$$$ $$$\\bigg|$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$5$$$ $$$\\bigg|$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$\\bigg|$$$ $$$5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"1175G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1175/problem/G"}